<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Battle Hall!\rI run the Single and\nDouble Battle challenges.\rHeads up, these challenges\nis for one Hustler. Solo dolo.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Which challenge you\nwant?{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">At the Battle Hall, you can run\nSingle or Double challenges solo.\rFor Single Battles, you roll\nin with one homie at least Lv. 30.\rDouble Battles need you to\nroll in with two of the same kinda\fhomie, both at least Lv. 30.\rWin-streak records get kept for\neach kinda homie.\rSo ANY homie can go for\nno. 1.\rWhen you walk in the Hall, you\npick the type and rank of\fthe homies you wanna scrap.\rWin ten in a row, and you\nget Battle Points (BP).\rIf you wanna dip mid-run,\nsave the game first.\rIf you don’t save, you\ngettin’ disqualified. No cap.\rDon’t say I ain’t warn you!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Battle Hall!\rI run the Multi Battle\nchallenge.\rHeads up, this challenge\nneed two Hustlers.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You tryna run the Battle Hall\nMulti Battle challenge? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can team up with a homie for a\nMulti Battle challenge with the\fsame kinda homie, both at\fleast Lv. 30.\rWhen you walk in the Hall, you\npick the type and rank of\fthe homies you wanna scrap.\rWin ten in a row, and you\nget Battle Points (BP).\rHeads up: a Battle Hall Multi Battle\nrun can’t get paused.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Come back when you got the heart!\nOr at least a snack. We hungry.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Which level you wanna run?\nLevel 50 or Open Level?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I gotta save the game before\nI let you in. That cool?{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Right this way!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Come back soon, hear?\nThe chairs miss you.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Look who back!\rI gotta save the game before you\npick up where you left off. Hold up.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AYO!\rYou ain’t save before you dipped\nlast time.\rSo that run is DEAD. You\ndisqualified. Them the rules!\fI don’t make ’em. I just enjoy ’em.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AYYY, congrats!\rFor that W, we givin’ you this\nsouvenir print! Frame it!\fOr don’t. It’s your life.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Gold Print got added to\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Vs. Recorder!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Silver Print got added to\n{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Vs. Recorder!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SINGLE BATTLE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">DOUBLE BATTLE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TAKE CHALLENGE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">INFO</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">CANCEL</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">LEVEL 50</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">OPEN LEVEL</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">CANCEL</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wanna raise strong homies but got\nno clue which one to pick...?\rFor Hustlers like that, the Battle\nFactory hit different!\fYou try ’em before you commit.\fLike a gym membership.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You right about that.\rThey say life is one long lesson.\rThis the best spot to learn about\nscraps and other Hustlers...\fI’m on lesson 4,000. Still failin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aaaaand--BAM!\nAaaaaaaaaand--BAM!\rI ain’t got no homies yet, so I’m\npractice-throwin’ Nap Sacks!\fAt my little brother.\fHe don’t like it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Grandma! Yoo-hoo! GRANDMA!\nI came to trade Accessories!\fI got somethin’ just for you!\fIt’s a mustache. For your homie.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, good looks, baby...\rYou so cute and strong and sweet...\fI’m blessed to have a grandbaby\flike you.\r...Now go get Grandma some fries.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That lil girl over there with her\ngrandma...\rShe a straight-up MENACE in scraps.\nShe swept me in four turns.\fThen asked if I was OK.\fI was not OK.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One Hustler pick\n“BECOME LEADER.”\rThe other Hustler pick\n“JOIN GROUP.”{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We finna fire up DS Wireless\nCommunications.{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I gotta save the game before I\nlet you in. Hold up.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pick the homie you\nrollin’ in with.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s a win streak still saved\nfor {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}.\rDelete that record and start a\nnew run with {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}?{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AYO!\rYou ain’t got a single homie at\nleast Lv. 30!\fGo train! The Hall ain’t a daycare!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AYO!\rFor Double Battles you need two of\nthe same kinda homie, both at\fleast Lv. 30. Twins only.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Also, no Eggs. Obviously.\nEggs can’t fight. They just sit there.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Eggs and {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0} are not allowed\nto enter.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Eggs, {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}, and {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0}\nare not allowed to enter.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Eggs, {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0},\nand {STRVAR_1 0, 3, 0} are not allowed\fto enter.\r</language>
	</row>
