	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00055" index="55">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Eggs, {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0},\n{STRVAR_1 0, 3, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 4, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 5, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 6, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 7, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 8, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 9, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 12, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 13, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 14, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 15, 0}, {STRVAR_1 0, 16, 0},\f{STRVAR_1 0, 17, 0}, and {STRVAR_1 0, 18, 0}\fare not allowed to enter.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00056" index="56">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Come holla at me when you ready.\nI’ll be right here. Standin’. Forever.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00057" index="57">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Battle Hall Multi Battle\nchallenge need both partners to roll\fin with the same kinda homie.\rTalk it out with your homie and\npick the same kinda homie.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00058" index="58">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">CHALLENGE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00059" index="59">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You eat your fave food first or\nsave it for last?\rAt the Battle Hall, start with the\ntypes your homies don’t like.\rWhy?\r’Cause the other side level up\nas you keep goin’!\fAlso always eat the fries first.\fThey get soggy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00060" index="60">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That fancy stage!\rWin streaks get kept for EACH kind\nof homie. Every homie can make it.\rAin’t it beautiful you can go for\nthe top with ANY homie?\fEven a ugly one. ESPECIALLY a ugly one.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00061" index="61">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Slow...\rMy SLOWBRO a cutie, and he SCRAPPED\nthe Brain here. Took four hours.\rThe Brain match your level so it’s\nfair.\fHe still ain’t recovered. He nappin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00062" index="62">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SLOWBRO: ...Slow?\n...Bro?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00063" index="63">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Here’s a tip!\rDon’t just run the Hall with your\nfave homie.\rSpread it out across different\nkinds if you tryna build a record.\fDon’t put all your eggs in one homie.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00064" index="64">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">At the Battle Hall, same kinda\nhomie keep the same record.\rSo roll in different ones that know\ndifferent moves!\fLike different outfits. Same drip.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00065" index="65">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know how HOPPIP got two types--\nGrass AND Flying?\rMeaning it can show up as either one.\rMe?\rYou could think of me as...\na “Lighthearted” type and\fa “Baddie” type.\fWeak to compliments. Immune to haters.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00066" index="66">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A lil advice...\rAt the Battle Hall, the other side’s\nhomies match your level.\rSo use whoever you want, no stress.\nLevel don’t matter. Heart do.\fAnd type matchups. Mostly matchups.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00067" index="67">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Battle Hall keep your\nwin-streak records. Dope, huh?\r...Wait a sec!\rMe and my homie can start runs with\nthe same setup and see who last\flongest!\fLoser buy wings. I’m already hungry.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00068" index="68">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I keep track of the total wins from\nyour longest Single Battle streaks.\rI add up just the longest streak\nfor each kinda homie.\fI do it by hand. On a napkin.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00069" index="69">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When your total hit certain numbers,\nyou get BP. Like a loyalty card.\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, your total win-streak record\nis {STRVAR_1 55, 1, 0} right now.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00070" index="70">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your total hit {STRVAR_1 55, 2, 0}.\fHere go your BP. Don’t spend it all\fin one place.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00071" index="71">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When your total hit {STRVAR_1 55, 3, 0},\nyou get more BP. Keep grindin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00072" index="72">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got {STRVAR_1 53, 4, 0} BP!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00073" index="73">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, your total win-streak\nrecord sittin’ at {STRVAR_1 55, 1, 0}.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00074" index="74">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, your total win-streak\nrecord sittin’ at {STRVAR_1 55, 1, 0}.\r...GOOD GRACIOUS!\nThat number DISRESPECTFUL!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00075" index="75">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Winston: The Battle Hall been DRY\nlately.\rNo fire challengers. No crowd.\nJust me and the janitor clappin’.\rSomebody who can beat the Brain...\nAin’t there NOBODY?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00076" index="76">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Winston: Lemme guess.\nYou gettin’ into the Battle Hall?\fIt’s addictive, huh?\rThe more you win, the more homies\nyou see!\fI’m addicted too. I live here now.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00077" index="77">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Winston: ...\n...Oh, my bad for starin’!\rI saw you on stage last time.\nYou got that STAR quality.\rI’mma keep my eye on you.\nLike, a LOT. Don’t worry about it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00078" index="78">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Winston: I watch you EVERY time you\nhit the stage.\rYou fun to watch, lemme tell you.\rI made a poster. Two posters.\nOne for the wall, one for the car.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00079" index="79">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Winston: AYO!\nWhat you finna do this time?\rWhich homie you goin’ for a record\nwith next?\rI get too hype to sleep at night.\nThat’s why I been late to work.\fThey fired me. Worth it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00080" index="80">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Winston: AWESOME!\nSERIOUSLY AWESOME!\fYou BEYOND awesome!\rThe love you show ALL these homies...\nI’m cryin’. I ain’t even ashamed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00081" index="81">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Winston: I ain’t never seen homies\nscrap as fun as yours.\rYou the first of your kind.\rI brag about you to anybody who’ll\nlisten. And people who won’t.\fI got banned from a bus.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00082" index="82">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Winston: GO, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, GO!\nGO, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, GO!\rI’m workin’ on dance moves and\ncheers to hype you up!\rWanna see ’em? Keep runnin’ up them\nrecords!\fI already sprained my ankle twice.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00083" index="83">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Winston: You PHENOMENAL.\nAll them scraps on stage...\fAll them glory moments...\rYour star burn SO bright!\nI gotta wear sunglasses inside now!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00084" index="84">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Winston: The love you showed homies\nat the Battle Hall...\fIt’s as deep as it is wide...\rYou can count on me, Winston, to be\nyour lifelong fan.\rI named my son after you.\nMy wife is NOT happy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00085" index="85">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Serena: It’s about the Battle Hall...\nIt ain’t excited me lately.\rNo gorgeous challenger to make me\nscream.\rSomebody to make me a fan...\nAin’t there NOBODY?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00086" index="86">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Serena: Um... ’scuse me?\rIf you don’t mind me askin’, you\ngettin’ into the Battle Hall?\rIt’s addictive, right?\nThe more you win, the more homies\fshow up. Sorry. Sorry for talkin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00087" index="87">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Serena: Um... ’scuse me?\rI watched you on stage.\nIt gave me butterflies. Like, real\fones. I needed to sit down.\rYou don’t mind if I cheer for you\nfrom now on, do you? Please?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00088" index="88">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Serena: Um... ’scuse me?\rI cheer for you the best I can.\nI’m kinda quiet though.\rSo I made a sign. It says your name.\nIt’s deadass small. Sorry.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00089" index="89">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Serena: Um... ’scuse me?\rWhich homie you goin’ for a record\nwith next?\rWhen I think about it I get all\nchoked up and can’t sleep.\fI’m so sorry. I’m so tired.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00090" index="90">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Serena: Um... ’scuse me?\rFANTASTIC! It’s FANTASTIC!\nYou fabulously fantastic!\r...Sorry. That was loud.\nI’m gon’ go lay down.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00091" index="91">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Serena: I ain’t never seen homies\nscrap as fun as yours.\rI... I brag on you to all my\nhomies. I hope that’s OK.\rThey said I talk about you too much.\nI told ’em they jealous.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00092" index="92">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Serena: Hooray, hooray, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nGo, homies, go!\r...Oh! Um... ’scuse me.\rI been workin’ on a dance routine for\nyou. With Winston.\fWe not datin’. He just loud.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00093" index="93">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Serena: You inspire me SO much.\rAll that glory on that shinin’\nstage...\rJust seein’ you make me feel all\nhappy inside. ♫\fI made you a scrapbook. It’s 400\fpages. Sorry.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00094" index="94">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Serena: The love you showed homies\nat the Battle Hall is as deep\fas it is wide...\rYou love EVERY kinda homie.\nEven the ugly ones.\rI love you for bein’ so amazin’.\nAs a fan! As a fan. Sorry.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00095" index="95">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lyra: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\nI love watchin’ you scrap here.\r’Cause you have fun whether you win\nor lose!\fMostly lose. But you have fun!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00096" index="96">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ethan: The Battle Hall is FIRE for\nhomie nerds like me!\rSo many homies I ain’t never seen!\nI been takin’ notes!\fIt’s SO hard! I lost nine in a row!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00097" index="97">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mom: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rI couldn’t help checkin’ up on you!\nI brought snacks! And a sign!\rEverybody goin’ hard, but you look\nhappier than anybody!\rOh, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, that’s right!\rI’mma hit the Goldenrod Dept. Store\non the way home and cop you some\fstuff! With YOUR bread!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00098" index="98">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: You keep shockin’ me\nover and over.\rWhat a Hustler you turned out to be!\rCaught more homies than anybody\ncan believe, AND you scrap with ’em!\rI’m SO proud to know you!\nCan I get a picture? For the lab.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00099" index="99">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whitney: I love flashy events like\nthe Battle Hall!\rI ain’t sayin’ I wanna stand out in\nthe crowd...\rI just love when cute homies get all\nthe attention! Like my MILTANK!\fAnd me. Mostly me.</language>
	</row>
</body>
